1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:03,856
Light is the fastest thing in the universe.

2
00:00:04,006 --> 00:00:08,695
It covers about 300,000 kilometres every second.

3
00:00:08,845 --> 00:00:13,255
Fast enough to circle the Earth seven and a half times.

4
00:00:13,405 --> 00:00:17,271
Yet sunlight still needs eight minutes to reach us.

5
00:00:17,421 --> 00:00:21,700
Light from the nearest other star takes over four years.

6
00:00:21,850 --> 00:00:25,933
So every time you look up, you are seeing the past.

